        "sub": "{E0_WEATHER_SNOWFALL}",
        "text": "Snowfall: Snow was falling at the time of the inspection, or there had been recent snowfall before the inspection. Snow cover and freezing conditions, including residual conditions, may have concealed defects to roofs, rainwater goods, external surfaces, and the surrounding grounds. Some defects may only become apparent once the snow has melted and a further inspection may be required if concerns arise.",
        "tokens": [],
